e5-554c-954b-51c8f4ae33f3" :question/math-academy-id "q-182392" :question/problem "Find the missing values in the following truth table:" :question/worked-solution "First, we add a column for $A∧B.$ Remember that $A∧B$ is true if both $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nThen, we add a column for $¬(A∧B).$ Remember that the truth values of $¬(A∧B)$ are opposite those of $A∧B.$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,A∧B\\,$ | $\\,¬(A∧B)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4559bdf1-e658-5991-973b-1850639db1c5" "answer-field-ee6c6021-4135-5e83-9510-560eaf4934a5" "answer-field-2fc94c3d-55a6-52a8-befa-23370d9ac2eb" "answer-field-beaf4f62-b5f6-5599-ada6-b031d8f0f2c8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4559bdf1-e658-5991-973b-1850639db1c5" :answer-field/id #uuid "4559bdf1-e658-5991-973b-1850639db1c5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-60aec5ee-3aa6-551a-9801-5a69fcafe967" :answer-field/choices ["answer-60aec5ee-3aa6-551a-9801-5a69fcafe967" "answer-31a1a336-0977-5fd7-b705-264101c48ef3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-60aec5ee-3aa6-551a-9801-5a69fcafe967" :answer/id #uuid "60aec5ee-3aa6-551a-9801-5a69fcafe967" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31a1a336-0977-5fd7-b705-264101c48ef3" :answer/id #uuid "31a1a336-0977-5fd7-b705-264101c48ef3" :answer/type :answer.t